<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="ar" dir="rtl"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>نادي الدراسات القضائية والأنظمة</title></head><body style="font-family:sans-serif;text-align:center;padding:60px 20px"><p>جارٍ التحويل…</p><p><a href="./">الرئيسية</a></p>
<script>(function(){var m=location.pathname.match(/^(\/.*?\/|\/)(news|articles|events|library|reports|about|search)(\/.*)?$/);if(m){location.replace(m[1]+'#/'+m[2]+(m[3]||''))}else{var b=location.pathname.replace(/[^\/]*$/,'');location.replace(b)}})()</script></body></html>
